-13T00:00:25.517Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePrecision":"report","sourceId":"aihot-1afsx4l","originalSourceName":"GitHub Blog","family":"outlet-1045foe","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":null,"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","selected":false,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsqgeo2e02cvroxvpnycl2zi","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-07T04:49:10.918Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":[],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1afsx4l","name":"GitHub Blog","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-07T04:49:10.918Z"}],"sectionLabel":"技巧与观点","reportSummary":"AutoGPT 维护者发现，AI 智能体不会主动阅读文档，因此将指令放在 AGENTS.md 和技能文件中，并置于代码目录旁。他们通过强制 PR 模板、测试计划、CI 覆盖率门槛和 CLA 签名等门控机制，将智能体提交的 PR 从“不可用”转变为“可用但不符合路线图”。其中 CLA 签名因需浏览器和 OAuth 流程，被用作区分人类与智能体的“人类探测器”。","reportEdition":"2026-08-13","reportKind":"daily"},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsq5saxh051mro2e90h10exo","title":"我写了一本 AI 教科书——AI 还要多久才能写得更好？","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-08-13T00:00:25.517Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/cmsq5saxh051mro2e90h10exo","https://www.interconnects.ai/p/i-wrote-an-ai-textbook-how-long-until"],"articles":[{"id":"cmsq5saxh051mro2e90h10exo","title":"我写了一本 AI 教科书——AI 还要多久才能写得更好？","originalTitle":"","summary":"作者在完成一本 RLHF 教科书后反思，LLM 在长文非虚构写作上进展停滞，GPT 4.5 和 Kimi K2 等写作强模型已显老旧，而编码、数学等任务已接近超人水平。模型能改错字、做编辑，但组织整章内容时仍混乱且易出错，作者认为这阻碍了模型自主解决开放科学问题。","reason":"","url":"https://aihot.news/items/cmsq5saxh051mro2e90h10exo","originalUrl":"https://www.interconnects.ai/p/i-wrote-an-ai-textbook-how-long-until","publishedAt":"2026-08-13T00:00:25.517Z","sourcePublishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":null,"datePreci